#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000006
msgid ""
"I specialize in butterflies.\n"
"I'm, here to catch a Ulysses..."
msgstr "我专攻蝴蝶。\n我来抓尤利西斯……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000007
msgid ""
"Ulysses? Hmm, \n"
"I didn't think they lived in Costa Rica."
msgstr "尤利西斯？嗯，\n我不觉得它们会住在哥斯达黎加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000008
msgid "...Morphos, maybe?"
msgstr "……也许是摩尔福斯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000009
msgid ""
"That's it.. Need to get some before \n"
"the Washington Treaty goes into effect..."
msgstr "对，就是它……得赶在华盛顿条约\n生效前抓几只……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Says here Morphos aren't covered \n"
"under the treaty..."
msgstr "这说摩尔福斯\n不受条约保护……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000b
msgid "Ugh... Must have slipped my mind."
msgstr "呃……我一定是忘了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000c
msgid "You sure you're feeling all right?"
msgstr "你确定你没事吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000000
msgid "Our place is \"Outer Heaven.\" You'd fit right in."
msgstr "我们的地盘叫“世外天堂”。你会很适应的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000001
msgid "Outer Heaven... ?"
msgstr "世外天堂……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000003
msgid ""
"I'm probably better suited to \n"
"something like that than this \"paradise.\""
msgstr "比起这个“天堂”，\n我大概更适合那种地方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000004
msgid "Good. You get a free balloon trip for signing up."
msgstr "很好。报名就送免费热气球之旅。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000005
msgid "Enjoy it, you'll feel like a butterfly."
msgstr "享受吧，你会像蝴蝶。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000006
msgid "You're an agent, right? Who do you work for?"
msgstr "你是特工吧？替谁干活？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000007
msgid "Me? I was a Cold War tool, same as you."
msgstr "我？和你一样，冷战工具。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000008
msgid ""
"Now I'm not so useful anymore, so they \n"
"cut me loose... I don't answer to anyone."
msgstr "现在我没用了，他们\n就甩了我……我不听谁的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000009
msgid "...Call me Snake."
msgstr "……叫我SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000a
msgid "Snake... The name seems familiar somehow."
msgstr "SNAKE……这名字好像在哪听过。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000b
msgid "Probably just déjà vu."
msgstr "大概是既视感吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000c
msgid "...You see that there?"
msgstr "……你看到那边了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000d
msgid "Beyond the cloud forest. See those ruins?"
msgstr "云雾林那边。看到废墟没？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000f
msgid "That's where you'll find Dr. Strangelove's lab."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫博士实验室就在那。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000000
msgid "There's the chance that a pre-emptive strike could destroy all the missile bases"
msgstr "先发制人的打击有可能摧毁所有导弹基地"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000001
msgid "... Render them unable to retaliate."
msgstr "……让他们无法反击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000002
msgid ""
"But the biggest flaw in the theory is \n"
"that the decision to retaliate"
msgstr "但这个理论最大的漏洞在于，\n决定是否反击的"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000003
msgid "has to be made by human beings."
msgstr "必须是人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000004
msgid "Let me give you a real-world example."
msgstr "给你举个现实例子。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000005
msgid ""
"Let's say Country X launches first \n"
"against Country Y..."
msgstr "假设X国率先对Y国\n发动攻击……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000006
msgid ""
"If the people in charge \n"
"in Country Y are like you and me,"
msgstr "如果Y国的决策者\n和你我一样，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000007
msgid "they're not gonna be able to retaliate"
msgstr "他们不会发动反击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000008
msgid ""
"knowing that they're \n"
"effectively ending all human life. "
msgstr "因为他们知道那等于\n终结全人类的生命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000009
msgid "So then..."
msgstr "那么…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000a
msgid "the weak link in nuclear deterrence theory is the uncertainty of retaliation?"
msgstr "核威慑理论的薄弱环节就是反击的不确定性？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000b
msgid "Bingo."
msgstr "答对了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000c
msgid ""
"And that creates a \"loophole\" Country X \n"
"can exploit to launch the first strike."
msgstr "这就制造了一个X国\n可以利用来发动首轮攻击的“漏洞”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000d
msgid ""
"...Which is why we designed the system\n"
"to be unmanned."
msgstr "……所以系统\n才设计成无人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000e
msgid "With Peace Walker, retaliation is certain."
msgstr "有了和平行者，反击是必然的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000f
msgid ""
"It chooses the appropriate target \n"
"and launches a retaliatory nuclear strike"
msgstr "它会选择合适的\n目标并发动核反击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000010
msgid ""
"every time, without needing human input\n"
"to make the call."
msgstr "每次都是如此，无需人类\n来做决定。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000011
msgid "Launching a nuclear strike against Peace Walker"
msgstr "对和平行者发动核打击"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000012
msgid ""
"is tantamount to pushing the launch button\n"
"against yourself."
msgstr "就等于按下对准自己的\n发射按钮。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000000
msgid "Strangelove was recruited from the States, too."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫也是从美国招来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000001
msgid ""
"In the field of AI, \n"
"there's no one better, that's for sure,"
msgstr "在AI领域，\n没人比她更强，这点毋庸置疑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000002
msgid ""
"but, man, what a basket case! \n"
"She hates EVERYBODY."
msgstr "但是，天哪，她真是个神经病！\n她讨厌所有人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000003
msgid ""
"Go to the lab and \n"
"destroy Peace Walker's cerebrum."
msgstr "去实验室，\n摧毁和平行者的大脑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000004
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure they haven't finished\n"
"the final calibrations yet."
msgstr "我敢肯定他们还没完成\n最后的校准。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000005
msgid ""
"I'll lend you my ID card. \n"
"It'll get you through security at the lab."
msgstr "我把ID卡借给你。\n它能让你通过实验室的安检。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000006
msgid "Oh... And one more thing..."
msgstr "哦…还有件事…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000007
msgid "What's this? A letter of recommendation?"
msgstr "这是什么？推荐信？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000008
msgid "Yeah, it's, um... it's from me to Dr. Strangelove."
msgstr "对，是，呃……是我写给斯特兰奇洛夫博士的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000009
msgid "...Don't read it, OK?"
msgstr "……别看，好吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000a
msgid "So what will you do now?"
msgstr "那你怎么办？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000b
msgid "I... I'm done with science."
msgstr "我……我不搞科学了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000c
msgid ""
"At this rate, I'm probably already \n"
"halfway to hell anyway."
msgstr "照这样，我大概已经\n半只脚踏进地狱了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000d
msgid "Not so fast. Why not join us?"
msgstr "别急。加入我们吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000000
msgid "Anyway, long story short, the butterfly got away."
msgstr "总之，长话短说，蝴蝶跑了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000001
msgid ""
"So how about it, doc? \n"
"Did you make that big \"butterfly\" too?"
msgstr "那么，博士？\n那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000002
msgid "Yes... "
msgstr "是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000003
msgid "and no."
msgstr "也不是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000004
msgid "What was that thing? What are they doing here?"
msgstr "那是什么？他们来干嘛？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000005
msgid ""
"Hmh. Something tells me \n"
"you're no ordinary entomologist."
msgstr "哼。我总觉得\n你不是普通的昆虫学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000006
msgid "The nukes were loaded on that machine."
msgstr "核弹被装上了那台机器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000007
msgid "The project's entering its final phase."
msgstr "计划已进入最终阶段。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000008
msgid "Project...?"
msgstr "计划……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000009
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "没错。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000a
msgid "The thermonuclear warheads they brought in,"
msgstr "他们运来的热核弹头，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000b
msgid "the bases scattered throughout Costa Rica,"
msgstr "遍布哥斯达黎加的基地，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000c
msgid ""
"the mercenaries, the AI weapons, \n"
"the research we were conducting here..."
msgstr "雇佣兵、AI武器、\n我们在这里进行的研究……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000d
msgid "It's all for this..."
msgstr "全都是为了这个……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000000
msgid ""
"They're going to deploy \n"
"a new type of nuclear weapon"
msgstr "他们将要部署 \n一种新型核武器"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000001
msgid "along the Caribbean coast of Latin America."
msgstr "部署一种新型核武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000002
msgid "A mobile, unmanned nuclear platform."
msgstr "一种可移动的无人核平台。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000003
msgid "Unmanned... nuclear platform...?"
msgstr "无人……核平台……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000004
msgid ""
"A fail-deadly system that can \n"
"automatically move into position"
msgstr "一种失效即致命的系统，可以 \n自动移动到指定位置"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000005
msgid "and launch a retaliatory nuclear strike."
msgstr "并发动报复性核打击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000006
msgid "It can move on its own,"
msgstr "它能自行移动，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000007
msgid ""
"and stealth shields it from radar\n"
"and satellite detection,"
msgstr "且隐形设计使其能躲过雷达\n与卫星探测，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000008
msgid ""
"drastically reducing the risk of it being \n"
"destroyed in a pre-emptive strike."
msgstr "大幅降低遭先发制人打击\n摧毁的风险。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000009
msgid "And this is the new deterrent?"
msgstr "这就是新的威慑力量？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Supposed to be. \n"
"The problem is the locomotion system."
msgstr "本该如此。\n问题出在移动系统上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000b
msgid ""
"There's no dry season in the Caribbean. \n"
"It rains all year round."
msgstr "加勒比没有旱季。\n全年都在下雨。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000c
msgid "The terrain is full of tropical rainforest..."
msgstr "地形遍布热带雨林……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000d
msgid ""
"A lot of the time \n"
"you can't even build a proper road."
msgstr "很多时候\n连像样的路都修不了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000e
msgid "...So I went back to where it all started."
msgstr "……于是我回到了最初的起点。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000010
msgid "Legs. Walking power."
msgstr "腿。行走能力。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000000
msgid ""
"A mobile launcher carrying a thermonuclear \n"
"warhead even more powerful"
msgstr "一台移动发射平台，搭载的热核\n弹头威力甚至超过"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000001
msgid ""
"than the Soviet RDS-220's (Tsar Bomba). \n"
"That's Peace Walker."
msgstr "苏联RDS-220（沙皇炸弹）。\n这就是和平行者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000002
msgid "Chico's basilisco..."
msgstr "奇科的蛇怪…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000003
msgid "We did the assembly and field testing here."
msgstr "组装和实地测试都在这做的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000004
msgid "A walking nuke..."
msgstr "行走核弹…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000005
msgid ""
"I sort of borrowed the original idea \n"
"from behind the Iron Curtain..."
msgstr "我算是从铁幕背后\n借来了最初的点子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000006
msgid "The missing link between infantry and artillery."
msgstr "步兵与火炮之间缺失的一环。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000007
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000008
msgid "Metal Gear..."
msgstr "合金装备……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000000
msgid ""
"It's kind of a hike. And besides, \n"
"there's a sure fire way to halt the project... "
msgstr "路可不近。而且，\n有个万无一失的办法能中止这个项目……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000001
msgid "You see, Peace Walker... isn't quite finished yet."
msgstr "你看，和平行者……还没完全完工。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ab
#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44d/0x000000
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "什么意思？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000003
msgid "It's missing one last critical structural component:"
msgstr "它还缺最后一个关键结构部件："

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000004
msgid "the AI."
msgstr "AI。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000005
msgid "Its brain."
msgstr "它的大脑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000006
msgid ""
"The Reptile Pod, \n"
"the electronic brain I was working on,"
msgstr "爬虫舱，\n我一直在研发的电子脑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000007
msgid ""
"can only follow commands like \n"
"\"go there, attack that.\""
msgstr "只能执行诸如\n“去那，打那”的命令。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000008
msgid ""
"I guess you could compare it \n"
"to the human cerebellum."
msgstr "我想你可以把它比作\n人类的小脑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000009
msgid "But for nuclear deterrence to work,"
msgstr "但要让核威慑生效，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000a
msgid ""
"it must function in place of \n"
"a human decision-maker."
msgstr "它必须代替\n人类决策者发挥作用。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000b
msgid ""
"It needs something to analyze \n"
"the huge volumes of data coming in"
msgstr "它需要某种东西来分析\n涌入的海量数据"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000c
msgid "and select an appropriate target for retaliation."
msgstr "并选定合适的报复目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000d
msgid "Hence, it needs the high-level decision-making ability of a cerebrum."
msgstr "因此，它需要大脑级别的高级决策能力。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000e
msgid "The mechanical cerebrum..."
msgstr "机械大脑……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000f
msgid ""
"The hardware configuration is \n"
"modeled on the human brain,"
msgstr "硬件配置是\n以人脑为模型设计的，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000010
msgid ""
"similar to the pod I worked on... \n"
"but its role is completely different."
msgstr "和我做过的那个舱体相似……\n但作用完全不同。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000011
msgid "Where's it being made?"
msgstr "在哪里制造？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000012
msgid "A research lab to the north."
msgstr "北边的一间研究所。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000013
msgid ""
"An AI expert named Dr. Strangelove is \n"
"developing it. Very hush-hush."
msgstr "AI专家斯特兰奇洛夫博士\n在开发它。极其机密。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000014
msgid "Dr. Strangelove..."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫博士……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000e
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000018
msgid "But..."
msgstr "但是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000001
msgid "They'd actually need to deploy dozens of them."
msgstr "他们实际得部署几十台。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000002
msgid ""
"Coldman needs funding for that. \n"
"And to get it, he's planning a test,"
msgstr "科尔德曼需要为此筹款。\n为了拿到钱，他正计划一次试验，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000003
msgid ""
"which will also serve as a demonstration \n"
"for the folks back at Langley."
msgstr "这也将作为一次演示\n给兰利的人看。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000004
msgid ""
"Wait. He's launching a nuke to prove \n"
"that his perfect deterrent works?"
msgstr "等等。他要发射核弹来证明\n他那完美威慑有效？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000005
msgid ""
"In his words, \"to prove that if someone \n"
"attacks us, we will strike back.\""
msgstr "用他的话说，“证明谁攻击我们，\n我们就还击。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000006
msgid ""
"Put simply, nuclear deterrence is the idea \n"
"of using nukes to keep nukes in check."
msgstr "简单说，核威慑就是用核武\n来制约核武的理念。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000007
msgid "If one side launches nuclear weapons,"
msgstr "若一方发射核武器，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000008
msgid "the other is sure to launch theirs in retaliation."
msgstr "另一方必定发射核武报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000009
msgid ""
"Which makes launching an act of suicide. \n"
"In the end, neither side can use its nukes."
msgstr "这让发射等于自杀。\n最终双方都无法动用核武。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000a
msgid "It's thanks to this doctrine that"
msgstr "正因这一理论，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000b
msgid ""
"the world's two superpowers \n"
"have avoided all-out confrontation."
msgstr "世界两大超级大国\n才避免了全面冲突。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000c
msgid "Nuclear deterrence has brought us peace."
msgstr "核威慑为我们带来了和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000d
msgid ""
"At the very least, it's prevented another \n"
"World War from breaking out."
msgstr "至少，它阻止了另一场\n世界大战的爆发。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000e
msgid ""
"But the theory of nuclear deterrence \n"
"exists only on paper."
msgstr "但核威慑理论\n只存在于纸面上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000f
msgid ""
"In reality, there's no guarantee that either side \n"
"would follow through with retaliation."
msgstr "现实中，无法保证任何一方\n会真正实施报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000000
msgid ""
"It closes the loophole \n"
"in nuclear deterrence theory,"
msgstr "它堵上了\n核威慑理论的漏洞，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000001
msgid ""
"rendering our friends in Country X \n"
"completely unable to launch."
msgstr "让X国的朋友们\n完全无法发射。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000002
msgid ""
"What Coldman is saying is \n"
"that to achieve this goal,"
msgstr "科尔德曼的意思是，\n要实现这个目标，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000003
msgid ""
"we need to demonstrate that retaliation \n"
"will be carried out by a machine."
msgstr "我们需要证明报复行动\n将由机器来执行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000004
msgid "He will launch his nuke... "
msgstr "他会发射核弹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000005
msgid ""
"...And then his version of deterrence \n"
"will be complete."
msgstr "……然后他的威慑理论\n就完整了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000006
msgid "And you believe him?"
msgstr "你相信他？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000007
msgid "...I believe in peace through nuclear deterrence."
msgstr "……我相信通过核威慑实现的和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000008
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000006
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "为什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000009
msgid "My father worked on the Manhattan Project."
msgstr "我父亲参与过曼哈顿计划。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000a
msgid "He put his whole life into that research..."
msgstr "他把一生都投入了那项研究……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000b
msgid ""
"and all it created was this illusion of peace\n"
"called deterrence."
msgstr "而它创造的只是名为威慑的\n和平幻象。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000c
msgid "And then I was born... unable to walk."
msgstr "我出生了……无法行走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000d
msgid "I had no choice but to face up to the nukes."
msgstr "我别无选择，只能直面核武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000f
msgid ""
"if they do end up launching, \n"
"it'll all have been for nothing."
msgstr "如果他们真的发射了，\n一切都将白费。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000010
msgid "They've got to be stopped."
msgstr "必须阻止他们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000011
msgid "Where'd they take the warheads?"
msgstr "弹头被带去哪了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000012
msgid ""
"To a base near the border. \n"
"The final test is five days from now."
msgstr "边境附近的一个基地。\n最终测试在五天后。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000013
msgid "Where's the base?"
msgstr "基地在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000014
msgid "You're gonna stop them?"
msgstr "你要阻止他们？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000000
msgid ""
"We used this facility \n"
"to develop unmanned weapons."
msgstr "我们曾用这座设施\n研发无人武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000001
msgid "Unmanned?"
msgstr "无人的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000002
msgid "Robots. The one you just fought was a Pupa."
msgstr "机器人。你刚打的是蛹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000003
msgid ""
"There's also a flying type called Chrysalis, \n"
"and a treaded type... the Cocoon."
msgstr "还有飞行型的蝶蛹，\n和履带型的……茧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000004
msgid ""
"Motor control, target detection, \n"
"tracking, attack, capture,"
msgstr "马达控制、目标探测、\n追踪、攻击、捕获，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000005
msgid ""
"and transport functions are \n"
"all controlled by an electronic brain."
msgstr "以及运输功能\n全由电子脑控制。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000006
msgid "There's no need for a human pilot."
msgstr "不需要人类驾驶员。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000007
msgid "They can only follow simple commands, though. "
msgstr "不过它们只能执行简单指令。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000008
msgid "Why build them here?"
msgstr "为什么在这里造？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000009
msgid "For the CIA. They invited me here a year ago."
msgstr "为CIA造的。一年前他们请我来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000a
msgid "That's who that guy was."
msgstr "原来他是CIA的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000b
msgid ""
"The CIA's station chief for Central America. \n"
"Goes by the name of Hot Coldman."
msgstr "CIA驻中美洲站长。\n名叫霍特·科尔德曼。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Apparently he was some sort of hero \n"
"back at the height of the Cold War."
msgstr "据说冷战巅峰时期\n他算是个英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000d
msgid "He's the one running the show."
msgstr "这里由他说了算。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000e
msgid "We called it the \"Peace Walker Project.\" "
msgstr "我们叫它“和平行者计划”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000f
msgid "Peace Walker..."
msgstr "和平行者……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000000
msgid "Snake, how's the mule treating you?"
msgstr "SNAKE，骡子还好用吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000001
msgid ""
"At this pace, I should be there \n"
"by tomorrow morning."
msgstr "照这速度，明早\n我就能到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000002
msgid ""
"You've got to hurry.\n"
"The AI could be completed any time now."
msgstr "你得抓紧。\nAI随时可能完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000003
msgid "Would be nice to have a guide..."
msgstr "有个向导就好了…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000004
msgid ""
"Already on it. I've enlisted Paz to help you.\n"
"She knows the jungle pretty well."
msgstr "已经在办了。我让帕兹帮你。\n她很熟悉这片丛林。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000005
msgid ""
"Snake, I know you're an expert in survival,\n"
"but you need to stay alert."
msgstr "SNAKE，我知道你是生存专家，\n但还是要保持警惕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000006
msgid ""
"You're in an ancient jungle so foggy you can\n"
"hardly see the trees. "
msgstr "你身处一片古老丛林，浓雾中\n几乎看不清树木。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000007
msgid ""
"It is home to 2,500 species of plants,\n"
"including 400 types of orchids."
msgstr "这里栖息着2500种植物，\n包括400种兰花。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000008
msgid ""
"There are also 500 species of butterflies\n"
"and over 400 species of wild birds. "
msgstr "还有500种蝴蝶\n和400多种野鸟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000009
msgid "The bedrock is solid enough "
msgstr "基岩足够坚固"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"that Mayan ruins have miraculously survived\n"
"centuries of earthquakes. "
msgstr "玛雅遗迹竟奇迹般地挺过了\n数百年的地震。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x00000b
msgid "An AI lab in a Mayan ruin. "
msgstr "玛雅遗迹AI研究所。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000000
msgid "Who'd have thought, eh, Huey?"
msgstr "谁能想到呢，休伊？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000001
msgid ""
"My sentiments exactly. That doesn't\n"
"mean security's any less tight, though. "
msgstr "我完全同意。不过这不\n意味着安保会松懈。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000002
msgid "You still have the ID card I gave you, don't you?"
msgstr "我给你的ID卡还带着吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000003
msgid "Got it right here."
msgstr "就在这儿。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000004
msgid ""
"That'll get you through the gate no problem.\n"
"After that, you're on your own."
msgstr "这能让你顺利通过大门。\n之后就得靠你自己了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000005
msgid ""
"As long as the AI remains unassembled,\n"
"Coldman's plan's on ice."
msgstr "只要AI还未组装完成，\nColdman的计划就搁置着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000006
msgid "Ha, ha. What about security inside the lab?"
msgstr "哈哈。研究所里面的警备呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000007
msgid "Well, it shouldn't be a problem for you."
msgstr "嗯，对你来说应该不成问题。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000008
msgid "Strangelove demanded that "
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫要求"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000009
msgid ""
"the security presence inside \n"
"the lab be kept to a minimum."
msgstr "实验室内的\n安保人员保持在最低限度。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000a
msgid ""
"It's not all good news, Snake.\n"
"Coldman knows we're here. "
msgstr "不全是好消息，Snake。\nColdman知道我们在这里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000b
msgid ""
"He's raised security in the area \n"
"surrounding the lab."
msgstr "他加强了实验室\n周边地区的安保。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000c
msgid ""
"You'll be seeing a lot of that Chrysalis UAV and\n"
"a bunch of patrol choppers, too."
msgstr "你还会看到很多那架Chrysalis无人机和\n一堆巡逻直升机。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000d
msgid ""
"There may be scouts \n"
"in the jungle lying in ambush."
msgstr "丛林里可能\n有侦察兵埋伏。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000e
msgid "As you approach the lab, be extra vigilant."
msgstr "接近研究所时，格外警惕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000f
msgid "I'll be careful."
msgstr "我会小心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000000
msgid "They're looking for you. Stay sharp!"
msgstr "他们在找你。打起精神！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000001
msgid ""
"Snake, Strangelove's lab is \n"
"a few miles to the north."
msgstr "Snake，Strangelove的实验室\n在北边几英里处。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000002
msgid ""
"It won't be long before the AI is complete.\n"
"Don't let that happen!"
msgstr "AI很快就要完成了。\n别让那发生！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000000
msgid "I'm... an ornithologist."
msgstr "我是鸟类学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000001
msgid "A poacher...?!"
msgstr "偷猎者……？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000002
msgid ""
"The gun's for self-defense.\n"
"I'm looking for... that one rare bird... in Costa Rica."
msgstr "枪是用来自卫的。\n我在找……哥斯达黎加的那只稀有鸟……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000003
msgid "Which one? The quetzal?"
msgstr "哪种？凤尾绿咬鹃？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000004
msgid "Right, the quetzal."
msgstr "对，凤尾绿咬鹃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000000
msgid "I was trying to capture the quetzal's song."
msgstr "我想录凤尾绿咬鹃叫声。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000001
msgid "Making my way through a thicket, I saw immense ruins towering before me...."
msgstr "穿过一片灌木丛，眼前出现了巨大的遗迹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000005
msgid "You're the one who made the tape?"
msgstr "那盘磁带是你录的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000000
msgid ""
"The only thing I was allowed to keep were\n"
"my undergarments... "
msgstr "他们只允许我留下\n贴身衣物……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000001
msgid "so that I would not be able to escape..."
msgstr "这样我就没法逃走了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000002
msgid ""
"And now I am without even \n"
"the means to prove who I am. "
msgstr "如今我连\n证明自己身份的东西都没有了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000003
msgid "I will not make it home to Paris like this."
msgstr "这样我回不了巴黎。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000004
msgid "In that case... come to our place."
msgstr "那来我们那儿吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000005
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000223
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000006
msgid ""
"You don't need a passport there.\n"
"Don't even need a name."
msgstr "在那里不需要护照。\n连名字都不需要。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000007
msgid ""
"If you want to go back to Paris,\n"
"we'll take you there, any time."
msgstr "如果你想回巴黎，\n我们随时都能送你去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000008
msgid ""
"What I want is a shower, a change of clothes...\n"
"and a cigarette."
msgstr "我想要的是洗个澡、换身衣服……\n还有一根烟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000009
msgid "I've got a cigar. It's Cuban."
msgstr "我有雪茄。古巴的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000a
msgid "No French cigarettes? I prefer unfiltered... "
msgstr "没法国烟？我爱无滤嘴……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000b
msgid "...Fresh out."
msgstr "……刚抽完。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000c
msgid ""
"But come back to my place and you can\n"
"have all the French cigarettes you want."
msgstr "但跟我回去，法国烟你\n想抽多少有多少。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000000
msgid "I am loyal to myself."
msgstr "我只忠于我自己。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000001
msgid "...Who's there?!"
msgstr "……谁？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000002
msgid "...I was captured by that woman."
msgstr "……我被那女人抓了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000003
msgid ""
"But she was kind. She gave me food to \n"
"eat and even bathed me herself, each day."
msgstr "但她很善良。她给我吃的，\n甚至每天亲手给我洗澡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000004
msgid "But, she said I could go home in a month... "
msgstr "但她说我一个月后能回家……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000005
msgid "\"So whatever you do, don't take off the blindfold. "
msgstr "“所以无论如何，都别摘下眼罩。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000006
msgid "Do so, and you will never leave here.\""
msgstr "摘了，你永远别想离开。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x427df9/0x000000
msgid "What about me?"
msgstr "那我呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x427df9/0x000001
msgid "Stay put. Ever wonder what it's like to be a bird?"
msgstr "别动。你想过当鸟是什么感觉吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000000
msgid "Guess you didn't listen. How'd you escape?"
msgstr "看来你没听。怎么逃的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000001
msgid "I waited for an opening, stole an ID card. "
msgstr "我等到了机会，偷了张ID卡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000002
msgid ""
"They almost caught me, \n"
"but I managed to elude them... "
msgstr "他们差点抓到我，\n但我甩掉了他们……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000003
msgid ""
"You made it this far and then \n"
"succumbed to exhaustion."
msgstr "你撑到了这里，然后\n就累垮了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000004
msgid "I was barefoot... with no supplies."
msgstr "我光着脚……没补给。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000000
msgid "...Hey."
msgstr "……喂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000001
msgid ""
"Ah, tu m'as trouvée ! (You found me!)\n"
"C'est moi le loup ! (Tag! I'm it!)"
msgstr "啊，你找到我了！\n是我，抓到你了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000002
msgid "French..."
msgstr "法国的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000003
msgid ""
"Fini de jouer à cache-cache. \n"
"(Enough hide-and-seek.)"
msgstr "捉迷藏结束了。\n（捉迷藏玩够了。）"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000004
msgid "Dis-moi qui tu es. (Tell me who you are.)"
msgstr "告诉我你是谁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000000
msgid ""
"They're rare, but they're not covered\n"
"under the Washington Treaty."
msgstr "它们很稀有，但不在\n华盛顿条约的保护范围内。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000001
msgid "The Resplendent Quetzal is red-listed."
msgstr "凤尾绿咬鹃是濒危物种。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000002
msgid "Really... you know your stuff."
msgstr "真的……你挺懂行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000003
msgid "I am... an ornithologist myself."
msgstr "我……也是鸟类学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000004
msgid ""
"Well, we'll have to compare notes later.\n"
"Here, drink some of this."
msgstr "那以后我们得交流交流。\n来，喝点这个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000000
msgid "Oh, I am so sorry. I drank it all."
msgstr "哦，抱歉。我喝光了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000001
msgid "That facility... Did you see anybody else in there?"
msgstr "那个设施……你在里面见过别人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000002
msgid ""
"Well, there was another woman.\n"
"But I never saw her in person..."
msgstr "嗯，还有个女人。\n但我没见过她本人……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000003
msgid "Because, you know... the blindfold..."
msgstr "因为，你知道……蒙眼……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000004
msgid "Oh, yes... she often sang..."
msgstr "哦，对……她经常唱歌……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000005
msgid "Sang...?"
msgstr "唱歌……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000006
msgid "It was such a strange song..."
msgstr "那首歌很奇怪……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000007
msgid ""
"What kind of person was she?\n"
"Could you tell anything from her voice?"
msgstr "她是什么样的人？\n能从声音听出什么吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000008
msgid ""
"I don't know. I don't even know \n"
"why I was held prisoner."
msgstr "不知道。我连自己\n为什么被关都不知道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000009
msgid ""
"They confiscated my equipment, my supplies,\n"
"my passport, money... everything."
msgstr "他们没收了我的装备、补给、\n护照、钱……所有东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000000
msgid "It sounds like heaven."
msgstr "听起来像天堂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000001
msgid "Close, but not quite. Outer Heaven."
msgstr "差不多，但不完全是。世外天堂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000002
msgid "It is sounding better all the time."
msgstr "越听越不错了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000003
msgid ""
"So, you must have gotten a look at the facility\n"
"when you escaped, right? "
msgstr "所以，你逃脱的时候一定看过那个设施\n对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000004
msgid "What's in there?"
msgstr "里面是啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000005
msgid ""
"...A lot of machinery. A big computer,\n"
"like you would see in a university..."
msgstr "……很多机器。一台大电脑，\n就像大学里那种……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000006
msgid ""
"What about the room where you heard\n"
"the voice? Anybody in there?"
msgstr "你听到声音的那个房间呢？\n里面有人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000007
msgid "I don't know. There was a tube..."
msgstr "不知道。有个管子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000008
msgid "A large tube, in the back..."
msgstr "一个大管子，在后面……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000009
msgid "When I approached it, I heard a voice."
msgstr "我靠近时听到一个声音。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x00000a
msgid "What did it say?"
msgstr "它说了啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x00000b
msgid "...\"Jack.\""
msgstr "……“杰克。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000000
msgid "Please, do not kill me..."
msgstr "求求你，别杀我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000001
msgid "You're no soldier... "
msgstr "你不是士兵……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000002
msgid "I am a tourist..."
msgstr "我是游客……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000003
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "你叫啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000004
msgid "...Please..."
msgstr "……求你了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000005
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "你在这里做什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000006
msgid "Cécile Cosima Caminades."
msgstr "塞西尔·科西玛·卡米纳德斯。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000000
msgid "Haa... You saved me."
msgstr "哈……你救了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000001
msgid "They told me this was a paradise... "
msgstr "他们告诉我这里是天堂……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000002
msgid ""
"that there were more rare birds here \n"
"than anywhere else... "
msgstr "这里的稀有鸟类比其他任何地方\n都要多……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000003
msgid "that there was no war here... that it was safe..."
msgstr "说这里没有战争……很安全……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000004
msgid ""
"They told me it was every birder's dream.\n"
"But... they were wrong."
msgstr "他们说这是每个观鸟者的梦想。\n但……他们错了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000005
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "怎么了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000006
msgid "...If only I had not recorded that stupid voice..."
msgstr "……要是我没录那蠢声音就好了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000007
msgid "...Voice?"
msgstr "……声音？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000000
msgid "Yes, it simply said \"Jack,\" over and over."
msgstr "对，它不停说“杰克”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000063
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000064
msgid "Jack..."
msgstr "杰克……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000002
msgid ""
"...Listen, you've got to get me out of here.\n"
"I really need a shower!"
msgstr "……听着，你得把我弄出去。\n我真得洗个澡了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000003
msgid "Wait here. I've still got business to take care of."
msgstr "在这等着。我还有事要处理。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000004
msgid ""
"What? You're not thinking of going in there,\n"
"are you? You can't leave me here!"
msgstr "什么？你不是想进那里去吧？\n你不能把我丢在这！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000005
msgid "Relax. I'll have some friends pick you up."
msgstr "放心。我会叫几个朋友来接你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000006
msgid "This is Miller."
msgstr "我是米勒。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000007
msgid "One for recovery. A civilian."
msgstr "回收一个。平民。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000008
msgid ""
"Snake, we don't have room for \n"
"any more civilians here."
msgstr "SNAKE，我们这里没地方\n再收平民了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000009
msgid "Not even for a blonde Parisienne?"
msgstr "金发巴黎女郎也不行？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000a
msgid "A what?! So she's, uh... pretty foxy?"
msgstr "一个什么？！这么说她，呃……挺性感的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000b
msgid ""
"See for yourself. If what she's saying is true,\n"
"I think we've found Paz's friend."
msgstr "你自己看。若她说的是真的，\n我们找到帕兹朋友了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000c
msgid "The missing one?"
msgstr "失踪那个？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000d
msgid "I'm thinking that she's the one that made that tape. "
msgstr "我觉得那盘磁带就是她录的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000e
msgid "Have her listen to it when she gets there."
msgstr "等她到了让她听听。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000f
msgid "So she's safe, then. Good news."
msgstr "那她安全了。好消息。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000010
msgid "I'm sure Paz will be glad to hear it."
msgstr "帕兹听到肯定高兴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000011
msgid ""
"You bet. Snake, the ruins are just up ahead. \n"
"Head north."
msgstr "当然。SNAKE，遗迹就在前面。\n往北走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000012
msgid "On my way."
msgstr "这就去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xb27d78/0x000000
msgid "You're not... one of the soldiers? "
msgstr "你不是……士兵吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xb27d78/0x000001
msgid "Please, lower your gun..."
msgstr "拜托，枪放下……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e34/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4282bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4a8abf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xb666bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xbe6ebf/0x000000
msgid "Don't move!"
msgstr "别动！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e34/0x000001
msgid ""
"\"Don't move\"... You men and your guns,\n"
"you all say the same thing."
msgstr "\"别动\"……你们这些人拿着枪，\n说的话都一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000000
msgid "The Boss..."
msgstr "BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000001
msgid "Well...?! What do you have to say for yourself?!"
msgstr "怎么……？！你还有什么好说的？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000002
msgid "...she betrayed America. "
msgstr "……她背叛了美国。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x327df8/0x000000
msgid "What... "
msgstr "什么……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x327df8/0x000001
msgid "It can't be..."
msgstr "不可能……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000000
msgid "Looks like death wasn't ready for you yet."
msgstr "看来死神还没打算收你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000001
msgid "Boss...?!"
msgstr "BOSS……？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000002
msgid "And who might you be?"
msgstr "你又是谁？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000003
msgid "You..."
msgstr "你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000004
msgid "Doctor... Strangelove, I presume."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫博士吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000005
msgid "...I've been waiting, Snake."
msgstr "……我一直在等你，SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000006
msgid "Yes, waiting without joy or pleasure..."
msgstr "没错，毫无喜悦地等着……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000007
msgid "Waiting for the one I despise!"
msgstr "等着我憎恨的那个人！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000000
msgid "I suppose you're here to destroy my research..."
msgstr "我猜你是来毁掉我的研究的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000001
msgid ""
"Yes, I know. Just as I know \n"
"what you did 10 years ago."
msgstr "是的，我知道。就像我知道\n你10年前干了什么一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000002
msgid "Go on, kill me like you killed her."
msgstr "来吧，像杀她一样杀我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000003
msgid "Kill me like you killed The Boss."
msgstr "像杀THE BOSS一样杀了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000004
msgid "Kill me!"
msgstr "杀了我！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000005
msgid "What exactly do you...?"
msgstr "你到底……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e58/0x000000
msgid ""
"She stole a Davy Crockett \n"
"and then defected to the other side."
msgstr "她偷了一枚戴维·克罗克特\n然后叛逃到了对面。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000000
msgid ""
"Her personal history, military records,\n"
"physiological data, correspondence, "
msgstr "她的个人履历、军事记录、\n生理数据、往来信件，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000001
msgid "the files for every operation she took part in."
msgstr "她参与过的每一次行动的档案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000002
msgid ""
"Every decision she ever made at \n"
"every possible turn."
msgstr "她在每个岔路口\n做的每个决定。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000003
msgid "What she took, and what was taken from her."
msgstr "她夺走了什么，又被夺走了什么。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000004
msgid ""
"Her pain and her pleasure, her joy and sorrow,\n"
"her life and death."
msgstr "她的痛苦与欢愉，喜悦与悲伤，\n她的生与死。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000005
msgid "And yes, even you."
msgstr "没错，甚至包括你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000006
msgid "Wh...why would you do that?"
msgstr "为……为什么要那么做？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000007
msgid "Coldman sought an MAD based AI that would deliver an effective retaliatory strike "
msgstr "科尔德曼想要一种基于MAD的AI，能发动有效的报复打击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000008
msgid ""
"against the most appropriate target \n"
"in response to a nuclear attack"
msgstr "针对最合适的目标\n以回应核攻击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000009
msgid "from a hypothetical adversary."
msgstr "来自假想敌的核攻击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x00000a
msgid ""
"An unmanned device to act as a deterrent,\n"
"capable of making the decisions"
msgstr "一种无人装置充当威慑，\n能够做出决策，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000000
msgid ""
"She used an American nuclear weapon \n"
"to attack Soviet territory."
msgstr "她用美国的核武器\n攻击了苏联领土。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000001
msgid ""
"The only way for Washington to prove\n"
"its innocence to Moscow... "
msgstr "华盛顿向莫斯科证明\n自身清白的唯一办法……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000002
msgid "was to eliminate the traitor themselves."
msgstr "就是亲手除掉叛徒。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000003
msgid "The Boss' death was the only thing that could have prevented all-out nuclear war."
msgstr "THE BOSS的死是唯一能阻止全面核战争的办法。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000004
msgid "Is that what you call the \"truth\"?"
msgstr "这就是你所谓“真相”？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000005
msgid "It's the truth as it was told to me."
msgstr "这是别人告诉我的真相。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000006
msgid ""
"So the truth is that you sullied \n"
"the reputation of your mentor, "
msgstr "所以真相就是你玷污了\n你导师的名誉，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000007
msgid ""
"the woman you loved most in this world,\n"
"before you buried her?"
msgstr "那个你在这世上最爱的人，\n然后才将她埋葬？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000008
msgid "...It was my mission."
msgstr "……那是我的任务。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000009
msgid ""
"Hmph. So that's the conclusion you came to\n"
"in order to live with yourself."
msgstr "哼。这就是你为了活下去\n得出的结论。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000a
msgid "What's The Boss to you?"
msgstr "THE BOSS对你来说是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000b
msgid ""
"I'm the one she abandoned \n"
"when she left this world."
msgstr "我是她离开这个世界时\n抛弃的人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000c
msgid ""
"I won't rest until I get answers \n"
"from the woman I loved. "
msgstr "得不到我所爱之人的答案，\n我绝不罢休。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000d
msgid "You and I are the same. We are the walking dead."
msgstr "你和我一样。我们都是行尸走肉。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000000
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000005
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000000
msgid "Boss...?"
msgstr "BOSS……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000001
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000003
msgid "Jack!"
msgstr "杰克！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000004
msgid "Go home! I'm not your Boss anymore!"
msgstr "回家！我不再是你BOSS了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000007
msgid "No, I..."
msgstr "不，我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"This is my baby, my Morpho butterfly.\n"
"It's neither pupa nor cocoon, but an imago, "
msgstr "这是我的宝贝，我的闪蝶。\n它既非蛹也非茧，而是成虫，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"a complete individual, \n"
"in the fullest sense of the word."
msgstr "一个完整的个体，\n名副其实的完整。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000002
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000115
msgid "Is someone there?"
msgstr "有人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000004
msgid "We have a visitor. I'll introduce him."
msgstr "有访客，我来引见。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000005
msgid "...Don't try anything foolish."
msgstr "……别耍花样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000006
msgid "As long as we're in here, I can reduce you to carbon at the press of a button."
msgstr "只要在这里面，我按个按钮就能把你化成灰。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000000
msgid "...Care for a sniff?"
msgstr "……要来一点吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000001
msgid "It's only snuff. You're a cigar man, aren't you? "
msgstr "只是鼻烟。你是抽雪茄的吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000002
msgid ""
"Well, there's no smoking in there,\n"
"so if you want to meet her,"
msgstr "那里面不能抽烟，\n所以你要是想见她，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000003
msgid "you'd best partake now."
msgstr "最好现在就抽。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000004
msgid "...Follow me."
msgstr "……跟我来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000000
msgid "and taking the actions that human beings cannot."
msgstr "并采取人类无法采取的行动。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000001
msgid ""
"I therefore concluded he required a cool,\n"
"calculating machine "
msgstr "所以我断定他需要一台冷静、\n精算的机器，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000002
msgid ""
"programmed to inflict swift, sure,\n"
"and utter annihilation upon the enemy. "
msgstr "被编程为对敌人施以迅速、可靠、\n彻底的毁灭。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000003
msgid "No retaliation. "
msgstr "不予报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000004
msgid ""
"But he took it upon himself\n"
"to come up with a different answer."
msgstr "但他却自作主张，\n得出了不同的答案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000005
msgid ""
"He said he needed the thought patterns of \n"
"the very finest rational mind, "
msgstr "他说他需要最优秀的理性头脑的\n思维模式，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000006
msgid "one that thought on a global scale, took both past and future into consideration,"
msgstr "一个以全球尺度思考、兼顾过去与未来，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000007
msgid ""
"and reached the best decision, \n"
"no matter how painful."
msgstr "并做出最佳决断的人，\n无论多么痛苦。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000008
msgid ""
"And that's why you asked for \n"
"everything they had on The Boss?"
msgstr "所以你要了他们手上\n关于THE BOSS的全部资料？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000009
msgid "It was the logical thing to do."
msgstr "这是合乎逻辑的做法。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000a
msgid ""
"I knew of only one person \n"
"who could be entrusted with the fate "
msgstr "我只知道有一个人\n可以被托付全人类的命运，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000b
msgid "of the entire human race."
msgstr "全人类的命运。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000c
msgid "What's your real goal here?"
msgstr "你真正的目的是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000d
msgid "To clear her name."
msgstr "洗清她的名声。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Why was a legendary hero forced \n"
"to betray her country? "
msgstr "传奇英雄为何被迫\n背叛祖国？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Why was she targeted for assassination by you,\n"
"her most beloved disciple?"
msgstr "为何你——她最心爱的弟子\n要置她于死地？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000010
msgid "I have no use for fabrications..."
msgstr "我不需要编造的东西……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000011
msgid "I want the truth... The Boss' last will."
msgstr "我要真相……THE BOSS的遗志。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000000
msgid "Would you like to meet her?"
msgstr "你想见她吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000001
msgid "The Boss is gone."
msgstr "BOSS死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000002
msgid "Not so fast!"
msgstr "别急！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000003
msgid ""
"You'd like to meet her, wouldn't you? \n"
"I can arrange it."
msgstr "你想见她，对吧？\n我可以安排。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000004
msgid "You took her life. I gave it back."
msgstr "你杀了她，我又救活。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000005
msgid "...You what?"
msgstr "……你说什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000000
msgid "A man..."
msgstr "一个男人……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000001
msgid "A war fighter..."
msgstr "战士……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000002
msgid "Boss? ...Is that you?"
msgstr "BOSS？是你吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000003
msgid "I call it the Mammal Pod."
msgstr "我叫它哺乳舱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000004
msgid "Mammal Pod?"
msgstr "哺乳舱？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000005
msgid "For my participation on the project, "
msgstr "作为参与该项目的条件，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000006
msgid ""
"I demanded access to \n"
"all information on The Boss. "
msgstr "我要求获取\nTHE BOSS的所有情报。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000007
msgid "Everything the CIA had."
msgstr "CIA掌握的一切。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927ec3/0x000000
msgid ""
"Complete your mission, Snake.\n"
"Extinguish that noble soul once again, if you can."
msgstr "完成任务，SNAKE。\n若你办得到，就再次熄灭那高贵的灵魂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000000
msgid "You must be dying to know yourself."
msgstr "你一定也想知道吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a9
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000005
msgid "No..."
msgstr "不……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000002
msgid ""
"No. She abandoned her country... \n"
"abandoned us all."
msgstr "不。她弃国……\n弃了我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000003
msgid "Really..."
msgstr "是吗……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000004
msgid "You think you understand her feelings?"
msgstr "你以为你懂她的感受？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000005
msgid ""
"You're trying to recreate The Boss' last will... \n"
"is that it?"
msgstr "你想重现THE BOSS的遗志……\n是这样吗？"
